{
  "mark.9.p1.b1": {
    "text": "我实在告诉你们，站在这里的，有人在没尝死味以前，必要看见神的国大有能力临到。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我实⁠在告⁠诉你⁠们，站⁠在这⁠里的，有⁠人在没尝死味以⁠前，必⁠要看⁠见神⁠的国大有能⁠力临⁠到。"
  },
  "mark.9.p1.b2": {
    "text": "过了六天，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "过了六⁠天，"
  },
  "mark.9.p1.b3": {
    "text": "耶稣带着彼得、雅各、约翰暗暗地上了高山，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣带着彼⁠得、雅⁠各、约⁠翰暗⁠暗地⁠上了高⁠山，"
  },
  "mark.9.p1.b4": {
    "text": "就在他们面前变了形象，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就⁠在他⁠们面⁠前变了形⁠象，"
  },
  "mark.9.p2.b1": {
    "text": "衣服放光，极其洁白，地上漂布的，没有一个能漂得那样白。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "衣⁠服放⁠光，极⁠其洁⁠白，地⁠上漂布的，没⁠有一⁠个能漂得那⁠样白。"
  },
  "mark.9.p2.b2": {
    "text": "忽然，有以利亚同摩西向他们显现，并且和耶稣说话。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "忽⁠然，有以⁠利⁠亚同摩⁠西向他⁠们显⁠现，并⁠且和耶⁠稣说⁠话。"
  },
  "mark.9.p3.b1": {
    "text": "拉比，我们在这里真好！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "拉⁠比，我⁠们在这⁠里真⁠好！"
  },
  "mark.9.p3.b2": {
    "text": "可以搭三座棚，一座为你，一座为摩西，一座为以利亚。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "可⁠以搭三座棚，一⁠座为你，一⁠座为摩⁠西，一⁠座为以⁠利⁠亚。"
  },
  "mark.9.p3.b3": {
    "text": "彼得不知道说什么才好，因为他们甚是惧怕。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "彼⁠得不⁠知⁠道说什⁠么才⁠好，因⁠为他⁠们甚⁠是惧⁠怕。"
  },
  "mark.9.p4.b1": {
    "text": "有一朵云彩来遮盖他们；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "有一⁠朵云⁠彩来遮⁠盖他⁠们；"
  },
  "mark.9.p4.b2": {
    "text": "这是我的爱子，你们要听他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这是我⁠的爱子，你⁠们要听他。"
  },
  "mark.9.p4.b3": {
    "text": "门徒忽然周围一看，不再见一人，只见耶稣同他们在那里。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "门⁠徒忽⁠然周⁠围一⁠看，不再⁠见一⁠人，只见耶⁠稣同他⁠们在那⁠里。"
  },
  "mark.9.p5.b1": {
    "text": "下山的时候，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "下⁠山的时⁠候，"
  },
  "mark.9.p5.b2": {
    "text": "人子还没有从死里复活，你们不要将所看见的告诉人。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "人⁠子还没⁠有从死里复⁠活，你⁠们不⁠要将所看⁠见的告⁠诉人。"
  },
  "mark.9.p5.b3": {
    "text": "门徒将这话存记在心，彼此议论「从死里复活」是什么意思。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "门⁠徒将这话存记在心，彼⁠此议⁠论「从死里复⁠活」是什⁠么意⁠思。"
  },
  "mark.9.p6.b1": {
    "text": "文士为什么说以利亚必须先来？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "文⁠士为⁠什⁠么说以⁠利⁠亚必⁠须先来？"
  },
  "mark.9.p6.b2": {
    "text": "以利亚固然先来复兴万事；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "以⁠利⁠亚固⁠然先来复⁠兴万⁠事；"
  },
  "mark.9.p6.b3": {
    "text": "经上不是指着人子说，他要受许多的苦被人轻慢呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "经上不⁠是指着人⁠子说，他⁠要受许⁠多的苦被⁠人轻⁠慢呢？"
  },
  "mark.9.p6.b4": {
    "text": "我告诉你们，以利亚已经来了，他们也任意待他，正如经上所指着他的话。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我告⁠诉你⁠们，以⁠利⁠亚已⁠经来了，他⁠们也任⁠意待他，正⁠如经上⁠所指着他的⁠话。"
  },
  "mark.9.p7.b1": {
    "text": "……又有文士和他们辩论。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "……又⁠有文⁠士和他⁠们辩⁠论。"
  },
  "mark.9.p7.b2": {
    "text": "众人一见耶稣，都甚希奇，就跑上去问他的安。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "众⁠人一见耶⁠稣，都甚希⁠奇，就跑上⁠去问他⁠的安。"
  },
  "mark.9.p7.b3": {
    "text": "你们和他们辩论的是什么？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们和他⁠们辩⁠论的⁠是什⁠么？"
  },
  "mark.9.p8.b1": {
    "text": "夫子，我带了我的儿子到你这里来，他被哑巴鬼附着。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "夫⁠子，我带了我⁠的儿⁠子到你这⁠里来，他被哑⁠巴鬼附⁠着。"
  },
  "mark.9.p8.b2": {
    "text": "无论在哪里，鬼捉弄他，把他摔倒，他就口中流沫，咬牙切齿，身体枯干。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "无⁠论在哪⁠里，鬼捉⁠弄他，把他摔⁠倒，他就口⁠中流沫，咬⁠牙切⁠齿，身⁠体枯⁠干。"
  },
  "mark.9.p8.b3": {
    "text": "我请过你的门徒把鬼赶出去，他们却是不能。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我请⁠过你⁠的门⁠徒把鬼赶⁠出⁠去，他⁠们却是不⁠能。"
  },
  "mark.9.p9.b1": {
    "text": "嗳！不信的世代啊……",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "嗳！不⁠信的世⁠代啊……"
  },
  "mark.9.p9.b2": {
    "text": "把他带到我这里来吧。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "把他带⁠到我这⁠里来吧。"
  },
  "mark.9.p9.b3": {
    "text": "他们就带了他来。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们就带了他来。"
  },
  "mark.9.p9.b4": {
    "text": "他一见耶稣，鬼便叫他重重地抽风……",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他一见耶⁠稣，鬼便叫他重⁠重地抽风……"
  },
  "mark.9.p10.b1": {
    "text": "他得这病有多少日子呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他得这病有多⁠少日⁠子呢？"
  },
  "mark.9.p10.b2": {
    "text": "从小的时候。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "从⁠小的时⁠候。"
  },
  "mark.9.p10.b3": {
    "text": "鬼屡次把他扔在火里、水里，要灭他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "鬼屡⁠次把他扔⁠在火里、水⁠里，要灭他。"
  },
  "mark.9.p10.b4": {
    "text": "你若能做什么，求你怜悯我们，帮助我们。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你若⁠能做什⁠么，求你怜⁠悯我⁠们，帮⁠助我⁠们。"
  },
  "mark.9.p11.b1": {
    "text": "你若能信，在信的人，凡事都能。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你若⁠能信，在信的人，凡⁠事都⁠能。"
  },
  "mark.9.p11.b2": {
    "text": "我信！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.9.p11.b3": {
    "text": "但我信不足，求主帮助。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "但我信不⁠足，求主帮⁠助。"
  },
  "mark.9.p12.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣看见众人都跑上来，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣看⁠见众⁠人都跑上⁠来，"
  },
  "mark.9.p12.b2": {
    "text": "你这聋哑的鬼，我吩咐你从他里头出来，再不要进去！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你这聋哑的鬼，我吩⁠咐你从他里⁠头出⁠来，再不⁠要进⁠去！"
  },
  "mark.9.p12.b3": {
    "text": "那鬼喊叫，使孩子大大地抽了一阵风，就出来了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "那鬼喊⁠叫，使孩⁠子大大⁠地抽了⁠一阵⁠风，就出⁠来了。"
  },
  "mark.9.p12.b4": {
    "text": "他是死了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠是死⁠了。"
  },
  "mark.9.p13.b1": {
    "text": "但耶稣拉着他的手，扶他起来，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "但耶⁠稣拉着他⁠的手，扶他起⁠来，"
  },
  "mark.9.p13.b2": {
    "text": "他就站起来了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他就站⁠起⁠来了。"
  },
  "mark.9.p13.b3": {
    "text": "我们为什么不能赶出他去呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我⁠们为⁠什⁠么不⁠能赶⁠出他去呢？"
  },
  "mark.9.p13.b4": {
    "text": "非用祷告，这一类的鬼总不能出来。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "非用祷⁠告，这一⁠类的鬼总不⁠能出⁠来。"
  },
  "mark.9.p14.b1": {
    "text": "他们离开那地方，经过加利利；耶稣不愿意人知道。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们离⁠开那地⁠方，经⁠过加⁠利⁠利；耶⁠稣不愿⁠意人知⁠道。"
  },
  "mark.9.p14.b2": {
    "text": "人子将要被交在人手里，他们要杀害他；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "人⁠子将⁠要被交在人手⁠里，他⁠们要杀⁠害他；"
  },
  "mark.9.p14.b3": {
    "text": "被杀以后，过三天他要复活。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "被杀以⁠后，过三⁠天他⁠要复⁠活。"
  },
  "mark.9.p14.b4": {
    "text": "门徒却不明白这话，又不敢问他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "门⁠徒却不明⁠白这话，又不⁠敢问他。"
  },
  "mark.9.p15.b1": {
    "text": "他们来到迦百农。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们来⁠到迦⁠百⁠农。"
  },
  "mark.9.p15.b2": {
    "text": "你们在路上议论的是什么？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们在路⁠上议⁠论的⁠是什⁠么？"
  },
  "mark.9.p15.b3": {
    "text": "门徒不作声，因为他们在路上彼此争论谁为大。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "门⁠徒不⁠作声，因⁠为他⁠们在路⁠上彼⁠此争⁠论谁为大。"
  },
  "mark.9.p15.b4": {
    "text": "若有人愿意作首先的，他必作众人末后的，作众人的用人。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "若⁠有人愿⁠意作首⁠先的，他必作众⁠人末后的，作众⁠人的用⁠人。"
  },
  "mark.9.p16.b1": {
    "text": "于是领过一个小孩子来，叫他站在门徒中间，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "于⁠是领⁠过一⁠个小⁠孩⁠子来，叫他站⁠在门⁠徒中⁠间，"
  },
  "mark.9.p16.b2": {
    "text": "凡为我名接待一个像这小孩子的，就是接待我；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "凡为⁠我名接⁠待一⁠个像这小⁠孩⁠子的，就⁠是接⁠待我；"
  },
  "mark.9.p16.b3": {
    "text": "凡接待我的，不是接待我，乃是接待那差我来的。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "凡接⁠待我⁠的，不⁠是接⁠待我，乃⁠是接⁠待那差我⁠来的。"
  },
  "mark.9.p17.b1": {
    "text": "夫子，我们看见一个人奉你的名赶鬼，我们就禁止他，因为他不跟从我们。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "夫⁠子，我⁠们看⁠见一⁠个人奉你⁠的名赶鬼，我⁠们就禁⁠止他，因⁠为他不⁠跟从我⁠们。"
  },
  "mark.9.p17.b2": {
    "text": "不要禁止他；因为没有人奉我名行异能，反倒轻易毁谤我。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:39"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "不⁠要禁⁠止他；因⁠为没⁠有人奉我名行异⁠能，反⁠倒轻⁠易毁⁠谤我。"
  },
  "mark.9.p17.b3": {
    "text": "不敌挡我们的，就是帮助我们的。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "不⁠敌挡我⁠们的，就⁠是帮⁠助我⁠们的。"
  },
  "mark.9.p17.b4": {
    "text": "凡因你们是属基督，给你们一杯水喝的，我实在告诉你们，他不能不得赏赐。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "凡⁠因你⁠们是属基⁠督，给你⁠们一⁠杯水喝的，我实⁠在告⁠诉你⁠们，他不⁠能不⁠得赏⁠赐。"
  },
  "mark.9.p18.b1": {
    "text": "凡使这信我的一个小子跌倒的，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:42"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "凡使这信我⁠的一⁠个小⁠子跌⁠倒的，"
  },
  "mark.9.p18.b2": {
    "text": "倒不如把大磨石拴在这人的颈项上，扔在海里。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:42"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "倒⁠不⁠如把大磨⁠石拴⁠在这人⁠的颈⁠项上，扔⁠在海⁠里。"
  },
  "mark.9.p18.b3": {
    "text": "倘若你一只手叫你跌倒，就把它砍下来；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:43"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "倘⁠若你一⁠只手叫你跌⁠倒，就⁠把它砍⁠下⁠来；"
  },
  "mark.9.p18.b4": {
    "text": "你缺了肢体进入永生，强如有两只手落到地狱，入那不灭的火里去。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:44"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你缺了肢⁠体进⁠入永⁠生，强如⁠有两只手落⁠到地⁠狱，入那不⁠灭的火里去。"
  },
  "mark.9.p19.b1": {
    "text": "倘若你一只脚叫你跌倒，就把它砍下来；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:45"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "倘⁠若你一⁠只脚叫你跌⁠倒，就⁠把它砍⁠下⁠来；"
  },
  "mark.9.p19.b2": {
    "text": "你瘸腿进入永生，强如有两只脚被丢在地狱里。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:46"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你瘸⁠腿进⁠入永⁠生，强如⁠有两只脚被丢在地⁠狱里。"
  },
  "mark.9.p19.b3": {
    "text": "倘若你一只眼叫你跌倒，就去掉它；你只有一只眼进入神的国，强如有两只眼被丢在地狱里。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:47"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "倘⁠若你一⁠只眼叫你跌⁠倒，就去⁠掉它；你只⁠有一⁠只眼进⁠入神⁠的国，强如⁠有两只⁠眼被丢在地⁠狱里。"
  },
  "mark.9.p19.b4": {
    "text": "在那里，虫是不死的，火是不灭的。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:48"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "在那⁠里，虫是不⁠死的，火是不⁠灭的。"
  },
  "mark.9.p20.b1": {
    "text": "因为必用火当盐腌各人。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:49"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "因⁠为必⁠用火当盐腌各⁠人。"
  },
  "mark.9.p20.b2": {
    "text": "盐本是好的，若失了味，可用什么叫它再咸呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:50"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "盐本是好⁠的，若失了味，可⁠用什⁠么叫它再咸呢？"
  },
  "mark.9.p20.b3": {
    "text": "你们里头应当有盐，彼此和睦。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 9:50"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们里⁠头应⁠当有盐，彼⁠此和⁠睦。"
  }
}
